#: accounts/templates/accounts/terms.html:19
#: content/templates/main/claim_stone.html:95
msgid ""
"Photos uploaded to StoneWalker (stone images, scan photos) may be used by "
"StoneWalker for promotional purposes and to improve our services, including "
"AI-based features such as image recognition and recommendation systems. By "
"uploading images, you grant StoneWalker a non-exclusive license to use these "
"images."
